msgid ""
"The page cannot be shown here. Compare the\n"
"                                    reference and the fingerprint below against the\n"
"                                    paper, and call the operations desk if in doubt."
msgstr "La page ne peut pas être affichée ici. Comparez la référence et l’empreinte ci-dessous avec le papier, et appelez le bureau des opérations en cas de doute."

#. module: dms_certify_portal
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:dms_certify_portal.verify_result
msgid "The paper does not match"
msgstr "Le papier ne correspond pas"

#. module: dms_certify_portal
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:dms_certify_portal.verify_result
msgid "The person you checked"
msgstr "La personne que vous contrôlez"

#. module: dms_certify_portal
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:dms_certify_portal.view_dms_certificate_form
msgid ""
"The printed fingerprint is the hash of the\n"
"                                        document as produced: a file cannot carry its\n"
"                                        own hash. Re-stamping changes the sealed file\n"
"                                        and leaves the printed value alone, so copies\n"
"                                        already sent keep verifying."
msgstr ""

#. module: dms_certify_portal
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:dms_certify_portal.field_dms_certificate__second_factor
msgid ""
"The reference alone never opens a document. This is what is asked for "
"alongside it, and it cannot be switched off."
msgstr ""

#. module: dms_certify_portal
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:dms_certify_portal.verify_form
msgid ""
"The reference and the second check have to\n"
"                                    come from the same document. We will not say\n"
"                                    which of the two failed. Check 0 against O\n"
"                                    and 1 against I — our references never use\n"
"                                    I, L, O or U — then try again."
msgstr "La référence et le second contrôle doivent provenir du même document. Nous ne dirons pas lequel des deux ne correspond pas. Vérifiez les caractères 0 et O, 1 et I — nos références n’utilisent ni I, ni L, ni O, ni U — puis réessayez."

#. module: dms_certify_portal
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:dms_certify_portal.view_dms_certificate_form
msgid ""
"The reference on its own never opens a document.\n"
"                                The second check is always required and cannot be\n"
"                                switched off; repeated failures lock the reference\n"
"                                and raise a warning here."
msgstr ""

#. module: dms_certify_portal
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:dms_certify_portal.field_dms_certificate__reference_key
msgid ""
"The reference with its separators stripped. What a lookup matches on, so "
"spacing and dashes never decide the outcome."
msgstr ""

#. module: dms_certify_portal
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:dms_certify_portal.verify_info
msgid ""
"The seal is not a picture pasted onto a PDF. The reference is\n"
"                    issued by our own server and bound to the fingerprint of the\n"
"                    file we produced. Changing a date, a name or a passport number\n"
"                    breaks that link — the page you read here stays the original."
msgstr "Le sceau n’est pas une image collée sur un PDF. La référence est émise par notre propre serveur et liée à l’empreinte du fichier que nous avons produit. Modifier une date, un nom ou un numéro de passeport casse ce lien — la page que vous consultez ici reste l’originale."

#. module: dms_certify_portal
#: model:ir.model.constraint,message:dms_certify_portal.constraint_dms_certificate_reference_unique
msgid "This certificate reference already exists."
msgstr ""

#. module: dms_certify_portal
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:dms_certify_portal.verify_result
msgid ""
"This reference was issued by us and then cancelled.\n"
"                                The paper in front of you is no longer valid, even if\n"
"                                it looks intact."
msgstr "Cette référence a bien été émise par nous, puis annulée. Le papier présenté n’est plus valable, même s’il paraît intact."

#. module: dms_certify_portal
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:dms_certify_portal.verify_result
msgid "This result stays readable for"
msgstr "Ce constat reste consultable pendant"

